      "summary": "Realized I would have to use the scientific method to convince people that we are being managed beyond our current perception of reality",
      "description": "Premise:\nExercising the scientific method begins with a philosophical argument.\nThere is no such thing as coincidence, and there is enough data to prove it.\nThe next generation of students can be trained to act perfectly logically towards a predetermined outcome.\nSuccess can be qualified by categorizing by asking CEOs what has led them to success?\nEvery answer can be measured, tested, and duplicated.\nI can relate multiple experiences from my own life to satisfy every category of success.\n\n\n\n\n\n",
